---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import checks from '../../../../../public/equipment/06-03/verification.json';
import m from '../../../../../public/equipment/06-03/interactions.json';
import {points} from '../../../../lib/equipment/06-03/solver.mjs';
const a='/equipment/06-03/',spec='https://www.cellink.com/product/lumen-x/',photo='https://www.cellink.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/LUMEN-X_Gen-3_Brochure.pdf#page=1';
const display=x=>typeof x==='string'?x:Object.entries(x??{}).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+String(v)).join('; ');
---
<Layout pageTitle="CELLINK LUMEN X Gen 3 documentary view" subtitle="" description="Inspect a dormant LUMEN X Gen 3 enclosure and read a detached abstract coordinate diagram." wide={true}>
<article id="lx" class="equipment"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/06-03/">← Equipment 06-03</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#lx-checks">Verification</a></nav>
<header><p class="eq-meta">06-03 / CELLINK LUMEN X Gen 3 / Dormant enclosure and abstract diagram</p><h2>CELLINK LUMEN X Gen 3</h2><p>Inspect the fixed outer case, then read the distance from the origin to one of three points on a separate abstract diagram. No action on the diagram affects the equipment.</p></header>
<div class="e-grid"><section class="e-card"><h3>01 · Inspect the dormant case</h3><div id="lx-views" class="e-row">{['Bench','Front','Exterior','Desk'].map(k=><button type="button" data-view={k.toLowerCase()}>{k}</button>)}<button id="lx-xr" type="button" disabled>VR unavailable</button></div><canvas id="lx-model" aria-label="Orbitable dormant LUMEN X Gen 3 exterior and independent diagram desk"></canvas><p id="lx-asset" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="e-hint">Click a small key on the detached desk to pick a point. The amber cover and front fascia never move. Drag to orbit, scroll or pinch to zoom.</p></section>
<section class="e-card"><h3>02 · Pick a diagram point</h3><div class="e-fields"><label>Point<select id="lx-point">{Object.keys(points).map(k=><option value={k}>{k}</option>)}</select></label></div><div class="e-row"><button id="lx-reset" type="button">Restore first point</button><button id="lx-json" class="e-run" disabled>Export readout JSON</button></div><p id="lx-status" role="status">No locator readout.</p><p id="lx-result" role="status">No point read.</p></section></div>
<section class="e-card"><h3>03 · Read the immutable diagram</h3><svg id="lx-diagram" viewBox="0 0 340 244" role="img" aria-label="Three points in an immutable abstract diagram and their lines from origin"><path d="M37 112H300M162 23V211" stroke="#8eaaa9" fill="none"/><circle cx="162" cy="112" r="3.8" fill="#284a58"/><text x="170" y="126" font-size="13" fill="#284a58">0, 0</text>{Object.entries(points).map(([k,[x,y]])=><g data-point={k}><path d={'M162 112L'+(162+10*x)+' '+(112-10*y)}/><circle cx={162+10*x} cy={112-10*y} r={6}/><text x={171+10*x} y={108-10*y} font-size="13">{k}</text></g>)}<text x="36" y="225" font-size="13" fill="#284a58">Original diagram · dimensionless coordinate units</text></svg>
<p>The readout is √(X² + Y²), using the two fixed coordinates as drawn. The chart has no file inputs and cannot generate geometry. JSON keeps the source ID, selected coordinates, distance, and separate readout revision. <a href={a+'example-point.json'}>Example JSON</a>.</p></section>
<section><h3>Documentary geometry</h3><div class="e-grid"><figure><img src={a+'original-front.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original LUMEN X Gen 3 shell with independent diagram desk"/><figcaption>Original reconstruction from the <a href={photo}>CELLINK brochure cover photo</a>. The diagram desk is invented and not an accessory.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={a+'original-work.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original fixed amber hood and unpowered front facade"/><figcaption>The amber hood is intentionally opaque and fixed; the display is blank. No internal parts or functions are represented.</figcaption></figure></div>
<p>The <a href={spec}>CELLINK Gen 3 product page</a> documents the 414 × 373 × 451 mm external dimensions. Shape details and trim are inferred. No instrument operation, biological or material content, exposure, settings, procedures or manufacturing output are included. The register’s fabrication acceptance is outside this documentary pass.</p></section>
<section id="lx-checks"><h3>Verification and files</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(x=><tr><td>{x.id}</td><td>{display(x.expected)}</td><td>{display(x.actual)}</td><td>{x.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'reference-plan.json'}>Predeclared cases</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification data</a> · <a href={a+'cellink-lumen-x-gen3.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'geometry-source.mjs'}>Editable geometry</a> + <a href={a+'make-model.mjs'}>generator</a> + <a href={a+'mesh-writer.mjs'}>mesh writer</a> · <a href={a+'interactions.json'}>Named targets</a>. {m.triangles.toLocaleString()} triangles and {m.draws} draw primitives; optional WebXR, physical headset untested.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/06-03/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
#lx header{max-width:73ch;padding:1.3rem 0}#lx h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:.2rem 0}#lx section{margin:1rem 0}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.e-card{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.e-card h3{margin:.3rem 0}.e-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.5rem 0}.e-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem}.e-fields label{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.e-fields input,#lx button{min-width:0;min-height:2.45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;padding:.3rem .5rem;box-sizing:border-box}#lx button:disabled{opacity:.52}.e-run{background:#3d596e!important;color:white!important}#lx-model{width:100%;height:clamp(280px,34vw,440px);display:block;background:#ebe8e0;touch-action:none}#lx-chart{width:100%;max-height:16rem}.e-over{overflow:auto}#lx table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}#lx td,#lx th{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#lx figure{margin:0}#lx img{width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:820px){.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.e-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
#lx caption{text-align:left}#lx input,#lx select,#lx button{min-width:0}#lx .e-hint{font-size:.92rem}#lx-diagram{width:min(100%,33rem);display:block;height:auto;background:#edeae0}#lx-diagram [data-point]{cursor:pointer;fill:#6d969d}#lx-diagram .selected{fill:#de9e54;outline:none}#lx-diagram [data-point] path{fill:none;stroke:#8bb1b5;stroke-width:1.5}#lx-diagram .selected path{stroke:#9b5c32;stroke-width:2.5}</style>
